@startuml
title Planning Template Architecture

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10

rectangle "Genetic Planner" as App

rectangle "Academic Template" as Academic {
    rectangle "Teachers"
    rectangle "Student Groups"
    rectangle "Classes"
    rectangle "Classrooms"
    rectangle "Teaching Periods"
}

rectangle "Work Shift Template" as Work {
    rectangle "Employees"
    rectangle "Work Assignments"
    rectangle "Workplaces"
    rectangle "Shift Periods"
}

rectangle "PlanningProblem" as Problem {
    rectangle "Resources"
    rectangle "Activities"
    rectangle "TimeSlots"
    rectangle "Locations"
    rectangle "Constraints"
}

rectangle "ProblemValidator" as Validator
rectangle "Genetic Engine" as Engine
rectangle "Schedule" as Schedule

App --> Academic
App --> Work

Academic --> Problem : build()
Work --> Problem : build()

Problem --> Validator
Validator --> Engine
Engine --> Schedule

note right of Engine
The Genetic Engine knows only
the generic PlanningProblem.

It does not depend on:
- Academic Template
- Work Shift Template
- Teacher
- Employee
- Subject
- Shift
end note

@enduml